{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A return to the roots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Traveler's Journey is a Voxel, Isometric, Tactical Turn based RPG. Travel through the islands as a lone leather worker as you unveil the secrets long since kept away from the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initial release includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 islands to explore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth blacksmithing system with levels to improve your work.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 quests in the main story to complete and explore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy a simple ttbs game then you\u2019ll find great enjoyment from A Traveler's Journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963530?t=1756407868","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3963530?t=1756407868","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963530/0944d15690b0d118b98b7d09d904cc0a777d1a74/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756407868","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963530/0944d15690b0d118b98b7d09d904cc0a777d1a74/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756407868","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game itself has some themes such as but not limited so \"Alcohol use, glorification of trial by combat (One of the boss fights is itself a trial by combat for an important item to progress in the game) There is more creationistic violence (There's not blood or use of gore.) There is mild foul language within the game, however not everyone is cursing or using mature language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A return to the roots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Traveler's Journey is a Voxel, Isometric, Tactical Turn based RPG. Travel through the islands as a lone leather worker as you unveil the secrets long since kept away from the villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initial release includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 islands to explore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth blacksmithing system with levels to improve your work.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 quests in the main story to complete and explore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy a simple ttbs game then you\u2019ll find great enjoyment from A Traveler's Journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Chaotic Duck Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3963530/358a73a9de0be8b2d4331ddfab50aaaa1ca2cc88/header.jpg?t=1756407868","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257184359,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184359/movie480.mp4?t=1756407866","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184359/movie_max.mp4?t=1756407866"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset